# Vercel KV (Redis) for signaling storage
# In production: Automatically provided by Vercel when you add a KV store
# For local development: Copy these from your Vercel project settings → Storage → KV → .env.local
#                        Create .env.local and paste the values to use KV locally
#                        If not set, falls back to in-memory storage
#
# Option 1: Direct Redis connection (simpler)
# KV_URL="redis://default:password@host:port"
#
# Option 2: REST API (Vercel's default)
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
# KV_REST_API_READ_ONLY_TOKEN=
